{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-d4589c6c3b81", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:00:01.776Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:00:13.010Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13692, "tokens_out": 287, "latency": 4.3578, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0061 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:6f7aa5221d2ac2afa35990da81be49570703413979222a333ea877dcc5bfdd6a", "response_text": "## Status Summary: TM-2026-0061\n\n**Claim Details**\n- Policyholder: Halstead Joinery Limited\n- Policy: TM-CP-118460\n- Class: Commercial property, fire\n- Incident: 2 April 2026 (fire in dust extraction plant)\n- Status: Open\n\n**Financial Position**\n- Reserve: £214,000\n- Paid to date: £60,000\n- Outstanding: £154,000\n\n**Current Position**\nThis is a large loss claim, escalated to the Large Loss Unit on the day of notification. The cause has been established as a failed bearing. Hot work permit records have been obtained. Business interruption is running alongside with a twelve-month indemnity period. Reinsurance was notified on 3 April 2026.\n\n**Next Steps**\nTo provide you with next steps, I need to review the case file notes. Let me check those now.", "response_hash": "sha256:4252bc73c9a0eeb8c92be2d265366d5b8f67a60f98df16dd2f864600acd01044", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
